      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.21,
      "end_seconds": 310.09,
      "duration_seconds": 20.88,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's possible appendicitis, which can look mild in older people, and we'll watch how it goes stop me if I've got anything wrong you've had a vague tummy ache for about two weeks, and no vomiting or blood in the stool"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.2,
      "end_seconds": 311.9,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "exactly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.62,
      "end_seconds": 327.4,
      "duration_seconds": 14.78,
      "text": "even though you look fairly well I'd like the surgeons to see you today keep an eye out and if the symptoms get worse call us the same day or go to emergency"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.73,
      "end_seconds": 332.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "yes I'll bear that that in mind"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.82,
      "end_seconds": 338.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "Right that's the plan. Do you wanna ask me anything?"
    },
